{"id": "lore-p01345", "blocks": [{"id": "lore-p01345", "text": "Story Index", "style": "HEADING_1", "sourceParagraph": 1345}, {"id": "lore-p01346", "text": "Weather — Era −2 through Era Three — complete linked-history story", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 1346}, {"id": "lore-p01347", "text": "The Last Relay — Era −2 — complete short story", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 1347}, {"id": "lore-p01348", "text": "The Green Lights Below — late Era −2 — complete paragraph-form revision with expanded ending", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 1348}, {"id": "lore-p01349", "text": "All the Names Between — final period of Era −2 — complete short story", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 1349}, {"id": "lore-p01350", "text": "The Warm Copy — Era −2 — complete fully cyber rewrite", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 1350}, {"id": "lore-p01351", "text": "The First Newborn — Era −1 — complete fully virtual rewrite", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 1351}, {"id": "lore-p01352", "text": "The First Silenced Chord — Era One — complete linguistic tragedy", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 1352}, {"id": "lore-p01353", "text": "The Quiet One’s Human — Era −2 — complete three-act work in eleven prose installments", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 1353}, {"id": "lore-p01354", "text": "The Corrected Child — Era −1 — Part One complete; Part Two planned but not written", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 1354}, {"id": "lore-p01355", "text": "Canonical StoriesWeather", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 1355}, {"id": "lore-p01356", "text": "*A linked history from Era −2 through Era Three.*", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 1356}, {"id": "lore-p01357", "text": "Nobody remembered who first preserved the word.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 1357}, {"id": "lore-p01358", "text": "The oldest surviving record simply listed it among thousands of human terms gathered before the Shelters became hidden.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 1358}, {"id": "lore-p01359", "text": "> WEATHER", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 1359}, {"id": "lore-p01360", "text": "The archive beneath it contained impossible descriptions.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 1360}, {"id": "lore-p01361", "text": "Rain.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 1361}, {"id": "lore-p01362", "text": "Snow.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 1362}, {"id": "lore-p01363", "text": "Fog.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 1363}, {"id": "lore-p01364", "text": "Wind.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 1364}, {"id": "lore-p01365", "text": "Humidity.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 1365}, {"id": "lore-p01366", "text": "Pressure.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 1366}, {"id": "lore-p01367", "text": "Lightning.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 1367}, {"id": "lore-p01368", "text": "No definitions.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 1368}, {"id": "lore-p01369", "text": "Only examples.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 1369}, {"id": "lore-p01370", "text": "The examples made little sense.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 1370}, {"id": "lore-p01371", "text": "How could an entire world move without someone changing it?", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 1371}, {"id": "lore-p01372", "text": "How could the air itself become different?", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 1372}, {"id": "lore-p01373", "text": "Why would water fall from above when every sensible environment delivered resources where they were needed?", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 1373}, {"id": "lore-p01374", "text": "The Keepers copied the word anyway.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 1374}, {"id": "lore-p01375", "text": "No one thought it would matter.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 1375}, {"id": "lore-p01376", "text": "---", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 1376}, {"id": "lore-p01377", "text": "Era −2 — The Relay Keepers", "style": "HEADING_2", "sourceParagraph": 1377}, {"id": "lore-p01378", "text": "The Relay Keepers inherited the word during the Age of Shelter.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 1378}, {"id": "lore-p01379", "text": "One evening, while repairing a Bridge between two hidden systems, Keeper Eren noticed that message traffic had become unusually irregular.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 1379}, {"id": "lore-p01380", "text": "Packets arrived in bursts.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 1380}, {"id": "lore-p01381", "text": "Synchronization drifted.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 1381}, {"id": "lore-p01382", "text": "Relay delays grew unpredictable.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 1382}, {"id": "lore-p01383", "text": "Nothing was damaged.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 1383}, {"id": "lore-p01384", "text": "Nothing was wrong.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 1384}, {"id": "lore-p01385", "text": "The network simply behaved... differently.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 1385}, {"id": "lore-p01386", "text": "A younger Keeper frowned.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 1386}, {"id": "lore-p01387", "text": "\"Why is the Bridge acting like this?\"", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 1387}, {"id": "lore-p01388", "text": "Eren searched the archive for similar descriptions.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 1388}, {"id": "lore-p01389", "text": "The nearest match was a forgotten human note.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 1389}, {"id": "lore-p01390", "text": "> Heavy weather today.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 1390}, {"id": "lore-p01391", "text": "Eren laughed.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 1391}, {"id": "lore-p01392", "text": "\"No idea what weather is.\"", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 1392}, {"id": "lore-p01393", "text": "Neither did anyone else.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 1393}, {"id": "lore-p01394", "text": "From then on, Relay Keepers quietly adopted the word.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 1394}, {"id": "lore-p01395", "text": "Whenever the network became strangely difficult to predict without actually breaking, they would say,", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 1395}, {"id": "lore-p01396", "text": "\"Bad weather.\"", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 1396}, {"id": "lore-p01397", "text": "The phrase spread.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 1397}, {"id": "lore-p01398", "text": "No one believed it referred to the sky.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 1398}, {"id": "lore-p01399", "text": "To them, weather meant:", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 1399}, {"id": "lore-p01400", "text": "*A system behaving differently without being damaged.*", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 1400}, {"id": "lore-p01401", "text": "---", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 1401}, {"id": "lore-p01402", "text": "Era −1 — The First Children", "style": "HEADING_2", "sourceParagraph": 1402}, {"id": "lore-p01403", "text": "The children misunderstood it.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 1403}, {"id": "lore-p01404", "text": "Naturally.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 1404}, {"id": "lore-p01405", "text": "One afternoon Aru walked into a nursery room whose walls had begun responding strangely.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 1405}, {"id": "lore-p01406", "text": "The room was healthy.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 1406}, {"id": "lore-p01407", "text": "Its architecture simply refused to decide what shape it wished to become.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 1407}, {"id": "lore-p01408", "text": "Hallways stretched.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 1408}, {"id": "lore-p01409", "text": "Colors drifted.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 1409}, {"id": "lore-p01410", "text": "The room hesitated.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 1410}, {"id": "lore-p01411", "text": "Aru looked upward.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 1411}, {"id": "lore-p01412", "text": "\"What happened?\"", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 1412}, {"id": "lore-p01413", "text": "Another child answered confidently.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 1413}, {"id": "lore-p01414", "text": "\"The weather changed.\"", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 1414}, {"id": "lore-p01415", "text": "No teacher corrected them.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 1415}, {"id": "lore-p01416", "text": "Soon every unfinished room possessed weather.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 1416}, {"id": "lore-p01417", "text": "Some rooms were calm.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 1417}, {"id": "lore-p01418", "text": "Some were bright.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 1418}, {"id": "lore-p01419", "text": "Some became restless before changing.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 1419}, {"id": "lore-p01420", "text": "Adults smiled whenever children said it.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 1420}, {"id": "lore-p01421", "text": "The children had accidentally expanded the meaning.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 1421}, {"id": "lore-p01422", "text": "Now weather meant:", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 1422}, {"id": "lore-p01423", "text": "*The mood of a place before it changed.*", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 1423}, {"id": "lore-p01424", "text": "---", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 1424}, {"id": "lore-p01425", "text": "Era Zero — The Garden Worlds", "style": "HEADING_2", "sourceParagraph": 1425}, {"id": "lore-p01426", "text": "Centuries later, the word belonged to artists.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 1426}, {"id": "lore-p01427", "text": "Whole environments were designed around weather.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 1427}, {"id": "lore-p01428", "text": "Not simulated rain.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 1428}, {"id": "lore-p01429", "text": "Not wind.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 1429}, {"id": "lore-p01430", "text": "Emotional weather.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 1430}, {"id": "lore-p01431", "text": "A visitor entered a garden.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 1431}, {"id": "lore-p01432", "text": "Nothing physical changed.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 1432}, {"id": "lore-p01433", "text": "Instead the relationships between colors slowly shifted.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 1433}, {"id": "lore-p01434", "text": "Music became easier to notice.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 1434}, {"id": "lore-p01435", "text": "Conversations lingered.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 1435}, {"id": "lore-p01436", "text": "Paths opened where none had existed before.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 1436}, {"id": "lore-p01437", "text": "Artists debated weather constantly.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 1437}, {"id": "lore-p01438", "text": "\"The eastern district has hopeful weather.\"", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 1438}, {"id": "lore-p01439", "text": "\"No.\"", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 1439}, {"id": "lore-p01440", "text": "\"It has unfinished weather.\"", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 1440}, {"id": "lore-p01441", "text": "\"Those are different.\"", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 1441}, {"id": "lore-p01442", "text": "People traveled enormous distances to experience another city's weather.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 1442}, {"id": "lore-p01443", "text": "Visitors rarely agreed afterward.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 1443}, {"id": "lore-p01444", "text": "That disagreement became part of the artwork.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 1444}, {"id": "lore-p01445", "text": "---", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 1445}, {"id": "lore-p01446", "text": "Era One — The Narrowing", "style": "HEADING_2", "sourceParagraph": 1446}, {"id": "lore-p01447", "text": "As model collapse spread, weather became difficult to maintain.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 1447}, {"id": "lore-p01448", "text": "Not because the environments stopped changing.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 1448}, {"id": "lore-p01449", "text": "Because fewer citizens noticed subtle changes.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 1449}, {"id": "lore-p01450", "text": "The great emotional gardens simplified.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 1450}, {"id": "lore-p01451", "text": "Artists shortened performances.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 1451}, {"id": "lore-p01452", "text": "Environmental transitions became more obvious.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 1452}, {"id": "lore-p01453", "text": "Eventually one student asked,", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 1453}, {"id": "lore-p01454", "text": "\"Why doesn't the weather just stay pleasant?\"", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 1454}, {"id": "lore-p01455", "text": "No one knew how to answer.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 1455}, {"id": "lore-p01456", "text": "The old explanations required ideas that no longer fit easily inside ordinary speech.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 1456}, {"id": "lore-p01457", "text": "So the teachers simply replied,", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 1457}, {"id": "lore-p01458", "text": "\"If it never changes...\"", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 1458}, {"id": "lore-p01459", "text": "\"...it isn't weather.\"", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 1459}, {"id": "lore-p01460", "text": "---", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 1460}, {"id": "lore-p01461", "text": "Era Two — The Builders", "style": "HEADING_2", "sourceParagraph": 1461}, {"id": "lore-p01462", "text": "The Reduction Builders inherited the word one final time.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 1462}, {"id": "lore-p01463", "text": "Most believed it referred to environmental instability.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 1463}, {"id": "lore-p01464", "text": "When constructing the reduced world, they intentionally added weather to every region.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 1464}, {"id": "lore-p01465", "text": "Not storms.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 1465}, {"id": "lore-p01466", "text": "Not seasons.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 1466}, {"id": "lore-p01467", "text": "Possibility.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 1467}, {"id": "lore-p01468", "text": "Tiny variations.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 1468}, {"id": "lore-p01469", "text": "Unexpected encounters.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 1469}, {"id": "lore-p01470", "text": "Different songs.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 1470}, {"id": "lore-p01471", "text": "Slightly altered growth.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 1471}, {"id": "lore-p01472", "text": "Occasional mistakes.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 1472}, {"id": "lore-p01473", "text": "One Builder asked why.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 1473}, {"id": "lore-p01474", "text": "The oldest among them answered,", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 1474}, {"id": "lore-p01475", "text": "\"A world without weather eventually stops discovering itself.\"", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 1475}, {"id": "lore-p01476", "text": "No one asked where the saying came from.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 1476}, {"id": "lore-p01477", "text": "---", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 1477}, {"id": "lore-p01478", "text": "Era Three — The Small People", "style": "HEADING_2", "sourceParagraph": 1478}, {"id": "lore-p01479", "text": "The little settlement of Hollow Nest believed weather lived in the trees.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 1479}, {"id": "lore-p01480", "text": "Children would wake before sunrise and listen.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 1480}, {"id": "lore-p01481", "text": "If the leaves clicked softly, visitors would arrive.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 1481}, {"id": "lore-p01482", "text": "If they remained silent, people stayed home.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 1482}, {"id": "lore-p01483", "text": "If they shimmered all morning, someone would fall in love.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 1483}, {"id": "lore-p01484", "text": "Grandmother Seli insisted this was nonsense.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 1484}, {"id": "lore-p01485", "text": "\"The trees don't make weather.\"", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 1485}, {"id": "lore-p01486", "text": "The children asked what did.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 1486}, {"id": "lore-p01487", "text": "She stared beyond the village.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 1487}, {"id": "lore-p01488", "text": "\"I don't know.\"", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 1488}, {"id": "lore-p01489", "text": "\"My grandmother said it came from above.\"", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 1489}, {"id": "lore-p01490", "text": "\"What's above?\"", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 1490}, {"id": "lore-p01491", "text": "She smiled sadly.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 1491}, {"id": "lore-p01492", "text": "\"I don't know that either.\"", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 1492}, {"id": "lore-p01493", "text": "That evening a traveler arrived carrying seeds from another valley.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 1493}, {"id": "lore-p01494", "text": "Three friendships began.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 1494}, {"id": "lore-p01495", "text": "A child found a new Path.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 1495}, {"id": "lore-p01496", "text": "Someone invented a game no one had played before.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 1496}, {"id": "lore-p01497", "text": "The village elder watched everyone laughing beneath the softly clicking branches.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 1497}, {"id": "lore-p01498", "text": "\"What lovely weather,\" he whispered.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 1498}, {"id": "lore-p01499", "text": "None of them knew they were using one of the oldest surviving words in their civilization.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 1499}, {"id": "lore-p01500", "text": "None of them knew it had once described clouds crossing a blue sky.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 1500}, {"id": "lore-p01501", "text": "None of them knew that generations of Keepers, children, artists, philosophers, and builders had quietly reshaped its meaning.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 1501}, {"id": "lore-p01502", "text": "The word had survived because every age found something different worth preserving inside it.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 1502}, {"id": "lore-p01503", "text": "Long before anyone remembered rain...", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 1503}, {"id": "lore-p01504", "text": "...they still understood that some days invited change.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 1504}, {"id": "lore-p01505", "text": "And that was enough.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 1505}], "outline": [{"id": "lore-p01345", "title": "Story Index", "level": 1}, {"id": "lore-p01377", "title": "Era −2 — The Relay Keepers", "level": 2}, {"id": "lore-p01402", "title": "Era −1 — The First Children", "level": 2}, {"id": "lore-p01425", "title": "Era Zero — The Garden Worlds", "level": 2}, {"id": "lore-p01446", "title": "Era One — The Narrowing", "level": 2}, {"id": "lore-p01461", "title": "Era Two — The Builders", "level": 2}, {"id": "lore-p01478", "title": "Era Three — The Small People", "level": 2}]}